{
  "schema": "2.0",
  "config": {
    "update_multi": true,
    "width_mode": "default",
    "enable_forward": true,
    "summary": {
      "content": "周报 | {{PERIOD_LABEL}}：{{SUMMARY_ONE_LINER}}"
    },
    "style": {
      "text_size": {
        "title": {
          "default": "heading-2",
          "pc": "heading-2",
          "mobile": "heading-3"
        },
        "body": {
          "default": "normal",
          "pc": "normal",
          "mobile": "normal"
        },
        "caption": {
          "default": "notation",
          "pc": "notation",
          "mobile": "notation"
        }
      },
      "color": {
        "cus-primary": {
          "light_mode": "rgba(30,120,255,1)",
          "dark_mode": "rgba(80,150,255,1)"
        },
        "cus-primary-bg": {
          "light_mode": "rgba(30,120,255,0.08)",
          "dark_mode": "rgba(80,150,255,0.12)"
        },
        "cus-muted": {
          "light_mode": "rgba(100,106,115,1)",
          "dark_mode": "rgba(150,155,163,1)"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "header": {
    "title": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "周报 | {{PERIOD_LABEL}}"
    },
    "subtitle": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "新闻情报主周 {{NEWS_WINDOW}}  ·  行业数据截至 {{DATA_AS_OF}}"
    },
    "template": "blue",
    "icon": {
      "tag": "standard_icon",
      "token": "chart_colorful"
    },
    "text_tag_list": [
      {
        "tag": "text_tag",
        "text": {
          "tag": "plain_text",
          "content": "新闻精选"
        },
        "color": "blue"
      },
      {
        "tag": "text_tag",
        "text": {
          "tag": "plain_text",
          "content": "行业数据"
        },
        "color": "wathet"
      }
    ]
  },
  "body": {
    "direction": "vertical",
    "padding": "12px 12px 20px 12px",
    "vertical_spacing": "12px",
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "column_set",
        "element_id": "overview",
        "flex_mode": "none",
        "background_style": "blue-50",
        "horizontal_spacing": "8px",
        "columns": [
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "padding": "12px",
            "vertical_spacing": "4px",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "content": "**本周概览**\n{{OVERVIEW_BULLETS}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "column_set",
        "element_id": "newsblk",
        "flex_mode": "none",
        "columns": [
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "padding": "4px 0px 0px 0px",
            "vertical_spacing": "8px",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "content": "**一、OTA/旅游行业新闻精选**\n\n{{NEWS_ITEMS}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "column_set",
        "element_id": "kpis",
        "flex_mode": "none",
        "horizontal_spacing": "8px",
        "columns": [
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "background_style": "grey-50",
            "padding": "12px",
            "vertical_spacing": "2px",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "content": "## <font color='{{KPI1_COLOR}}'>{{KPI1_VALUE}}</font>"
              },
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "text_size": "caption",
                "content": "<font color='grey'>{{KPI1_LABEL}}</font>"
              },
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "text_size": "caption",
                "content": "<font color='grey'>{{KPI_SCOPE}}</font>"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "background_style": "grey-50",
            "padding": "12px",
            "vertical_spacing": "2px",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "content": "## <font color='{{KPI2_COLOR}}'>{{KPI2_VALUE}}</font>"
              },
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "text_size": "caption",
                "content": "<font color='grey'>{{KPI2_LABEL}}</font>"
              },
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "text_size": "caption",
                "content": "<font color='grey'>{{KPI_SCOPE}}</font>"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "background_style": "grey-50",
            "padding": "12px",
            "vertical_spacing": "2px",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "content": "## <font color='{{KPI3_COLOR}}'>{{KPI3_VALUE}}</font>"
              },
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "text_size": "caption",
                "content": "<font color='grey'>{{KPI3_LABEL}}</font>"
              },
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "text_align": "center",
                "text_size": "caption",
                "content": "<font color='grey'>{{KPI_SCOPE}}</font>"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "column_set",
        "element_id": "datablk",
        "flex_mode": "none",
        "background_style": "grey-50",
        "columns": [
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "padding": "12px",
            "vertical_spacing": "8px",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "content": "**二、行业数据更新**\n<font color='grey'>{{DATA_WINDOW_CAPTION}}</font>\n\n**🏨 国内酒店**\n{{HOTEL_BODY}}\n\n**✈️ 国内航空**\n{{AVIATION_DOM_BODY}}\n\n**🌍 出境航空**\n{{AVIATION_INTL_BODY}}\n\n<font color='grey'>📅 {{FOOTNOTE}}</font>"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "button",
        "element_id": "opendash",
        "type": "primary_filled",
        "width": "fill",
        "size": "medium",
        "text": {
          "tag": "plain_text",
          "content": "打开行业数据看板"
        },
        "icon": {
          "tag": "standard_icon",
          "token": "chart_outlined"
        },
        "behaviors": [
          {
            "type": "open_url",
            "default_url": "https://datamax.fun"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
